thag12.2:7.1 starts: Alone, I stayed in the wilds,
thag12.2:7.2 starts: untiring,
thag12.2:7.3 starts: I followed the Teacher’s words,
thag12.2:7.4 starts: just as he, the Conqueror, had taught me.
thag13.1:5.1 starts: But those whose mindfulness immersed in the body
thag13.1:5.2 starts: is constantly well-undertaken,
thag13.1:5.3 starts: —who don’t engage in what shouldn’t be done,
thag13.1:5.4 starts: who persevere in what should be done,
thag13.1:5.5 starts: mindful, alert—
thag13.1:5.6 starts: their effluents go to their end.
thag13.1:12.1 starts: As a single mass of rock isn’t moved
thag13.1:12.2 starts: even so all
thag13.1:12.3 starts: forms, flavors, sounds,
thag13.1:12.4 starts: aromas, contacts,
thag12.1:12.1 starts: Here virtue is supreme,
thag12.1:12.2 starts: but one with discernment is the ultimate.
thag12.1:12.3 starts: Among human beings & devas
thag12.1:12.4 starts: one conquers
thag14.1:13.1 starts: And the goal for which I went forth
thag14.1:13.2 starts: from home life into homelessness
thag14.1:13.3 starts: I’ve reached:
thag14.1:13.4 starts: the end
